WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.328
The tracker is free. To keep your entries in one place, add it to your home screen.

00:07.216 --> 00:09.976
Tap Share at the bottom of Safari.

00:10.716 --> 00:13.404
Then tap Add to Home Screen.

00:14.216 --> 00:15.776
Tap Add.

00:16.716 --> 00:20.268
Now open the tracker from its home-screen icon.

00:20.716 --> 00:23.068
And your entries are right there.

00:23.818 --> 00:28.306
When you are ready, the Companion tab shows you how to subscribe.
